    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but even if i seek support, it just feels like more noise. more people trying to \"fix\" me or talk me into feeling things i just don't feel. it's like there's no way to actually get the grayness to stop. it just feels like a permanent part of me now. i just want everything to be still for once.",
